  "description": {
    "text": "Twenty-four cards, 001/T to 024/T, given only with Pokémon Card Trainers magazine: three in each issue from volume 14 in January 2002 to volume 21 in March 2003, when the magazine stopped. Instead of the black star PROMO symbol they carry a book with a card on it. Each issue's three cards belong together: Flareon, Vaporeon and Jolteon; the Slowpoke family; the middle stages of the Johto first partners, then of the Kanto ones; the three legendary birds; the Dratini line; the Larvitar line up to Tyranitar ex; and Imakuni?'s Whismur, Loudred and Exploud ex. Their release overlapped with the P and ADV-P promos."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A small card-shaped symbol at the bottom right, and a \"/T\" number"
  },
